OEM: [[SerComm]] • WW00A-1.6MM main board • Y200A-1.0MM :(or something similar) wireless module. Per the manual, the default SSID is '''NETGEAR'''.
===Links=== *[http://wiki.openwrt.org/toh/netgear/dg834gt On '''OpenWrt''' wiki] *[https://electronics360.globalspec.com/article/2265/netgear-dg834gt-superwireless-108mbps-adsl-router-teardown On '''Electronics360'''] *[http://www.skyuser.co.uk/forum/technical-discussion/7990-opening-up-sky-dg834gt.html Rebranded by Sky] (internal images)
===Specifications=== *CPU: [[Broadcom]] BCM6348KPB • ADSL2+ CPE, Single-Chip, Transceiver and AFE *Flash: [[Macronix]] MX29LV320ABTC-90 • 4MB (32Mb, 4Mx8bits), 70ns, 3V *RAM: [[Hynix]] HY57V283220(L)T(P)-7 • 16MB (128Mb, 4Banksx1Mx32bit), 3.3V, 143MHz *WLAN: Atheros AR5005GS Wireless Mini PCI Card :[[Atheros]] AR2414 • Single-Chip CMOS MAC/Baseband/Radio *Ethernet Switch: [[Broadcom]] BCM5325EKQM • 5-Port, 10/100
